OL,3,AUK and EU officials to discuss freedom
OL,4,Aof movement
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish and European officials will
OL,7,Fdiscuss the future options for the UK's
OL,8,Frelationship with the EU, Business
OL,9,FSecretary Jonathan Reynolds has told
OL,10,Fthe BBC.
OL,12,FOfficials on both sides are expected to
OL,13,Fbegin discussions about a range of
OL,14,Foptions, including free movement,
OL,15,Fbefore the EU summit on 20 November.
OL,17,FHowever, Downing Street has insisted
OL,18,Fthe government's current focus is on
OL,19,Fachieving new deals in areas such as
OL,20,Ffood and youth mobility at the summit.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
