OL,3,ALula's comeback in Brazil dents Trump's
OL,4,Aambitions for Latin America
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Brazil will not accept being anyone's
OL,7,Fbackyard," Brazil's left-wing President
OL,8,FLuiz Inacio Lula da Silva declared in
OL,9,Fhis election victory speech, a message
OL,10,Fsquarely aimed at Washington.
OL,12,FDomestic elections are rarely won on
OL,13,Fforeign policy, and this one was no
OL,14,Fdifferent. But Lula's defiance against
OL,15,Fwhat he has described as US
OL,16,Finterference in Brazilian affairs
OL,17,Fevoked a patriotic spirit that proved
OL,18,Fan effective campaigning tool.
OL,20,FIt also chimed with his wider brand of
OL,21,Fpolitics as a former union leader:
OL,22,Fstanding up to powerful figures.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
