OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATruce begins in Ukraine city where
OL,4,Aresidents ate weeds to survive
OL,5,
OL,6,FOleshky, along the front line in the
OL,7,FKherson region, is trapped on one side
OL,8,Fby the Dnipro River, which separates it
OL,9,Ffrom Ukrainian positions, and on the
OL,10,Fother by Russian forces.
OL,12,FMany residents have resorted to cooking
OL,13,Fgarden weeds to survive, telling the
OL,14,FBBC they are suffering extreme hunger
OL,15,Fand want to leave.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
